{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "John in Mexico", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "That's a Bad Sunburn!", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Celebrating Important Occasions > Day of the Dead", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify  health problems and ways of staying healthy, and use them in a limited range of social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking About Health Problems", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Explaining a Problem</span><br/>You can use the Simple Present tense in certain sentences to describe your health problems. <br/><br/>For example: <br/><span class=\"italic\">I am not feeling well. <br/>I have a cough. <br/>I have a bad back. <br/>I have a bad sunburn. <br/>I have a headache. <br/>I have a sore throat. <br/>I feel feverish. <br/>I have muscle cramps.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Symptoms</span><br/><br/>  When you see a doctor, he or she might ask, <span class=\"italic\">\u201cWhat are your symptoms?\u201d</span> <br/>Symptoms are feelings of illness or discomfort.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Modals Must vs. Should", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You can use the modals <span class=\"italic\">must</span>, <span class=\"italic\">have to </span> and <span class=\"italic\">should</span> to give recommendations. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " You must wear a shirt and put on sunblock when you are outside. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">must</span> and <span class=\"italic\">have to</span> to make very strong recommendations and to talk about necessity. <br/>  <span class=\"italic\">Should</span> is not as strong. It is a suggestion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You should also drink lots of fluids and get some rest.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "It is common to hear these types of suggestions at the doctor's office.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sunburn ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "red skin caused by exposure to the sun", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have a bad sunburn on my shoulders and back.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about health problems.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "sunstroke", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a health problem related to high body temperature", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Headache, fever and fatigue are all associated with sunstroke.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "shoulder", "type": "name"}, {"content": "part of the body that connects the arms to the torso", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I have a bad sunburn on my shoulders and back.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "feverish", "type": "name"}, {"content": "feeling hot and weak", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I also have a headache and I feel feverish.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "muscle cramps ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "pains in different muscles of your body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you have muscle cramps?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to be associated ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to be connected to something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Headache, feeling feverish and muscle cramps are all associated with sunstroke. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to avoid ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stay away from", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I strongly suggest you avoid the sun for a few days.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fluids", "type": "name"}, {"content": "liquids you can drink (water, juice, etc.)", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You must get some rest and drink lots of fluids. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue describing a health problem to your doctor.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Talk about the symptoms.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The doctor gives suggestions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": " Practice your dialogue.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I talk about a health problem with a doctor.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe symptoms.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask for and receive suggestions.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le12ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn4le12ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "10", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>:  What seems to be the problem today?<br/>"}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob05re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "1750", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I have a bad sunburn on my shoulders and back.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>: You have to be more careful in the sun.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: I also have a headache and I feel feverish.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>: Do you have muscle cramps?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yes."}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob05re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": " 12500", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>: Headache, feeling feverish and muscle cramps are all associated with sunstroke. I strongly suggest you avoid the sun for a few days.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: OK.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>: You must wear a shirt and put on sunblock when you are outside.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Could you recommend a brand?"}, {"image": "engenn4le12ob05re2img03.jpg", "id": 4, "time": "29000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>: Any product that has SPF 30 is fine. You should also drink lots of fluids and get some rest.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Could you tell me if I need to take any medication?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>: No, you don't need anything else.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Thank you, Doctor.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Doctor</span>:  You're welcome."}], "coverimg": "engenn4le12ob05re2img02.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le12ob05re6aud01", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn4le12ob05re6img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Vocabulary and Grammar", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "I can make polite requests.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can describe health problems.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can make strong suggestions and recommendations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Do you like to suntan? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Are you careful in the sun? How?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Do you think it's important to use sunblock?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 at